{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54400","headline":"偈 · 諲禅师","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙光山顶宝月轮，照耀乾坤烁暗云。\n尊者不移元一质，千江影现万家春。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷二十、《五灯会元》卷十三。\n前者但称龙光和尚，今从後书。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"諲禅师","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}